<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Свадьба Дарьи и Игоря — 03.01.2027</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100vh;
    font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 24px;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    position: relative;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #0B6E4F 0%, #0E5A43 55%, #6B1D2A 100%);
    background-size: 200% 200%;
    animation: bgShift 14s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes bgShift {
    0%, 100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
    50%      { background-position: 100% 50%; }
  }

  .snow {
    position: fixed;
    top: -10px;
    color: #F6F1E7;
    opacity: 0.85;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 1;
    animation: fall linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes fall {
    0%   { transform: translateY(-10vh) translateX(0) rotate(0deg); opacity: 0; }
    10%  { opacity: 0.9; }
    100% { transform: translateY(110vh) translateX(30px) rotate(180deg); opacity: 0; }
  }
  .snow:nth-child(1)  { left: 5%;  animation-duration: 9s;  animation-delay: 0s;   font-size: 12px; }
  .snow:nth-child(2)  { left: 15%; animation-duration: 12s; animation-delay: 2s;   font-size: 16px; }
  .snow:nth-child(3)  { left: 25%; animation-duration: 10s; animation-delay: 1s;   font-size: 10px; }
  .snow:nth-child(4)  { left: 35%; animation-duration: 14s; animation-delay: 3s;   font-size: 14px; }
  .snow:nth-child(5)  { left: 45%; animation-duration: 11s; animation-delay: 0.5s; font-size: 12px; }
  .snow:nth-child(6)  { left: 55%; animation-duration: 13s; animation-delay: 4s;   font-size: 16px; }
  .snow:nth-child(7)  { left: 65%; animation-duration: 9s;  animation-delay: 1.5s; font-size: 10px; }
  .snow:nth-child(8)  { left: 75%; animation-duration: 12s; animation-delay: 2.5s; font-size: 14px; }
  .snow:nth-child(9)  { left: 85%; animation-duration: 10s; animation-delay: 3.5s; font-size: 12px; }
  .snow:nth-child(10) { left: 95%; animation-duration: 15s; animation-delay: 0.8s; font-size: 16px; }

  .card {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    max-width: 480px;
    width: 100%;
    background: #F6F1E7;
    color: #3a2b2b;
    padding: 44px 30px 36px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    border: 2px solid #C9A96A;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    text-align: center;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(40px) scale(0.97);
    animation: cardIn 1.2s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) 0.2s forwards;
  }
  @keyframes cardIn {
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
  }

  .card::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 10px;
    border: 1px solid #6B1D2A;
    border-radius: 12px;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeIn 1s ease 1s forwards;
  }
  @keyframes fadeIn { to { opacity: 1; } }

  .sparkle {
    position: absolute;
    color: #C9A96A;
    font-size: 14px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: twinkle 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    z-index: 3;
  }
  .sparkle.s1 { top: 22px; left: 24px; animation-delay: 1.2s; }
  .sparkle.s2 { top: 30px; right: 26px; animation-delay: 2s; }
  .sparkle.s3 { bottom: 24px; left: 30px; animation-delay: 2.8s; }
  .sparkle.s4 { bottom: 30px; right: 24px; animation-delay: 1.6s; }
  @keyframes twinkle {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.6) rotate(0deg); }
    50%      { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.2) rotate(20deg); }
  }

  .top {
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #6B1D2A;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: slideUp 0.9s ease 0.7s forwards;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 30px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin: 8px 0 4px;
    color: #0B6E4F;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: slideUp 0.9s ease 1s forwards;
  }
  .amp { color: #6B1D2A; }
  .date {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: #6B1D2A;
    margin: 14px 0;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: slideUp 0.9s ease 1.3s forwards;
  }
  .divider {
    color: #C9A96A;
    font-size: 20px;
    letter-spacing: 6px;
    margin: 18px 0;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: slideUp 0.9s ease 1.5s forwards;
  }
  @keyframes slideUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(14px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
  p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: slideUp 0.9s ease 1.7s forwards;
  }
  .place {
    color: #0B6E4F;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: slideUp 0.9s ease 1.9s forwards;
  }
  a.map { color: #6B1D2A; }

  .btn {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 26px;
    padding: 14px 36px;
    background: #6B1D2A;
    color: #F6F1E7;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 30px;
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    border: 1px solid #C9A96A;
    overflow: hidden;
    opacity: 0;
    animation:
      slideUp 0.9s ease 2.1s forwards,
      pulse 2.8s ease-in-out 3s infinite;
    transition: background 0.3s ease;
  }
  .btn:hover { background: #0B6E4F; }
  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(201,169,106,0.55); }
    50%      { box-shadow: 0 0 0 12px rgba(201,169,106,0); }
  }
  .btn::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: -60%;
    width: 50%; height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.45), transparent);
    transform: skewX(-20deg);
    animation: shine 3.5s ease-in-out 4s infinite;
  }
  @keyframes shine {
    0%   { left: -60%; }
    40%  { left: 130%; }
    100% { left: 130%; }
  }

  .dress {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #6B1D2A;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: slideUp 0.9s ease 2.4s forwards;
  }
  .swatches { margin-top: 6px; letter-spacing: 4px; font-size: 18px; }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    *, *::before, *::after {
      animation: none !important;
      opacity: 1 !important;
      transform: none !important;
    }
    .snow { display: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <span class="snow">❄</span><span class="snow">❅</span><span class="snow">❆</span>
  <span class="snow">❄</span><span class="snow">❅</span><span class="snow">❆</span>
  <span class="snow">❄</span><span class="snow">❅</span><span class="snow">❆</span>
  <span class="snow">❄</span>

  <div class="card">
    <span class="sparkle s1">✦</span>
    <span class="sparkle s2">✧</span>
    <span class="sparkle s3">✧</span>
    <span class="sparkle s4">✦</span>

    <div class="top">МЫ ЖЕНИМСЯ</div>
    <h1>Дарья <span class="amp">&</span> Игорь</h1>
    <div class="date">3 января 2027 · 16:00</div>
    <div class="divider">❦ ❦ ❦</div>

    <p>Дорогие друзья!<br>
    Новый год. Новая глава. Новая семья.<br>
    Будем счастливы встретить этот день с вами.</p>

    <p class="place">
      📍 Ресторан «Доски»<br>
      г. Стерлитамак, ул. Гоголя, 175<br>
      <a class="map" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Стерлитамак+Гоголя+175" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Открыть на карте</a>
    </p>

    <a class="btn" href="https://forms.gle/ВАША_ССЫЛКА" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Подтвердить присутствие</a>

    <div class="dress">
      Дресс-код: изумруд и бордо<br>
      <span class="swatches">🟢 🔴 🟡</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>